<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The official launch of CAWP in 2024 formalized a new, long-term partnership between UC Berkeley researchers at Rausser College of Natural Resources and the California Department of Fish and Wildlife \(CDFW\). With additional support from the National Geographic Society, the project has assembled a multidisciplinary team of scientists, wildlife managers, and communicators to better understand the social and ecological factors that shape wolf populations and inform management decisions. The core team includes three postdoctoral researchers with expertise in socioeconomic and ecological sciences, a field manager with eight years of carnivore monitoring)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
