<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Once data validation is complete in early 2025, CAWP will be able to employ a three-pronged approach to this component: a regression to understand predictors of livestock depredation, a hotspot map of where livestock depredation risk is highest, and qualitative interviews with livestock producers to understand what tools are being used and where depredations are taking place.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4]
>>
